<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
   ROJAN AI: the role_preferences DataStore file is deliberately excluded
   below. This file backs session/role restore (RoleDataStore.kt) — if
   Android's Auto Backup silently restores it onto what a user/tester
   believes is a fresh install (e.g. after uninstall+reinstall, or on a
   new device signed into the same account), the app would correctly
   read a real but stale role from a previous install and route straight
   to that role's dashboard instead of Welcome. Excluding it here is what
   makes "fresh install always starts at Welcome" actually true, not just
   true in the code path that assumes DataStore is genuinely empty.

   DataStore (Preferences) files live under the "file" domain at
   datastore/<name>.preferences_pb — NOT the "sharedpref" domain the
   default template below shows, which would not have excluded this file.

   RC-1 Security Audit P1 fix: role_preferences (RoleDataStore.kt) has
   since been retired from the codebase — auth_session_preferences
   (data/local/AuthSessionDataStore.kt) is the CURRENT active
   session-restore mechanism (holds the logged-in person's id) and was
   never added here when it took over that role, leaving it exposed to
   the exact "stale session silently restored onto a fresh install/new
   device" risk the exclusion above exists to prevent. secure_token_preferences
   (data/local/SecureTokenStore.kt) — the AES-256-GCM/Android-Keystore-
   encrypted access/refresh token store — is excluded too: the ciphertext
   already can't be decrypted after a restore onto a different Keystore
   state (the key never leaves Keystore and isn't itself backed up), but
   a backed-up copy of authentication material shouldn't exist if it can
   be avoided at all, per standard guidance. The role_preferences line
   above is left in place — excluding an already-nonexistent file is a
   harmless no-op, not worth a churn-only removal in a security-focused
   change.
-->
<full-backup-content>
    <exclude domain="file" path="datastore/role_preferences.preferences_pb"/>
    <exclude domain="file" path="datastore/auth_session_preferences.preferences_pb"/>
    <exclude domain="sharedpref" path="secure_token_preferences.xml"/>
</full-backup-content>